46	// InterfacesModel is the tab that lists this machine's network interfaces.
47	//
48	// It was the Topology tab, which showed four sections read from ip and
49	// iptables in containers started with --network host — that is, the Docker
50	// Desktop VM's network and not the machine's (D57). Three of the four sections
51	// were removed rather than translated, because nothing portable produces them
52	// (§3.44); the route question moved to the Diagnostics pipeline, where it is
53	// asked about a target rather than in the abstract. What is left is what reads
